    "Mirrors are four distinct native effect instances; preserve their native order and parameters. Labels describe captured X/Y values, not renamed native effects.",
    "Opacity (0..1) is the effect amount/alpha control. InvertRGB A is alpha-channel inversion and remains 0 at capture; do not substitute it for opacity.",
