    "Blur strength is native Blur; Blur X/Y Distance are separate. Sharpen Strength is 0..1, Distance is native1..25. Preserve these units.",
    "All four mirrors were bypassed with opacity1 at capture. Invert, Blur and Sharpen were enabled at opacity1. A pulse that only raises opacity to1 will make no change on those already-full effects; choose an explicit toggle or an envelope from current state rather than assume an off baseline.",
